      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THE COPS (6) missed the placings two runs back then improved last start but just found a couple better over 1905m at Toowoomba, beaten 5.5 lengths after being prominent at the turn. Finds a suitable race and can find the winner's circle. O'CALDINO (1) went forward and proved too strong last time out, scoring by 2.5 lengths over 1905m at Toowoomba. Should go forward from the awkward gate and is nicely placed to figure in the outcome. UCELLE (7) has a moderate winning strike-rate but performed well last time at this track, finishing second and only 2.25 lengths from the winner at the end of 1900m after being in contention on the turn. Likely improver with strong prospects. The well-related CHEERFUL CAT (4) (half to G1 winner On The Bubbles) improved last start to finish third over 1900m at this circuit. Finds a nice race and can secure another top-three finish.",
